    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bcafea0946a5b58e7059eea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──然后啊，这边的团体被称为技巧派，\n大家都很会唱歌哦！所以可以学到很多。\n举例来说……",
      "source_fingerprint": "918b6349326ef5eafe6faa135ce9b95c1c50949941937275c685e1e3b4dcabfb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
