    {
      "uid": "zhcn:410461048d48555b94d222e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后来我们前往能播放影片的地方，\n并在“飞鹰子老师的偶像讲座”上，\n度过了一段愉快的时光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fa020921c9d0900d8b46e69838bbdc0d545475a971dc8cc299125d325b79e2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
