    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4cf696b3522c03950e6589f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我被醒目飞鹰带去参加\n知名偶像的跨年倒数演唱会，\n一起度过了跨年的瞬间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89d7a335e8db9b3dc4560b83ee458cc99f19d10f6a82bf43c6aefd5c9093b81d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:172bf97ca16a7958af488630",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然这的确是场很出色的演唱会，\n但持续看到早上还是让我十分疲倦。\n相较之下，她似乎反而从中获得了活力──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e28f2368de9291ba2b033d70284f34bd59772eb17e14667ae0a0c44bd661d88c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046101.json",
      "json_path": [
