    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8832461966b9df1296e3612",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "醒目飞鹰所提议的那些竞赛，我当然\n也已放进挑战计划中，而且无论任何竞赛，\n都会抱着拿第一的心态去参加。但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e6fec59d0fd2ae32e1ba2b44e8871655a12d6587e12ee75e1e357d8dae01857",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
