      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "仔细想想，她总是把理想的赛马娘偶像形象，\n投射在无声铃鹿身上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4567bcf9511627cc6aff4b0be3512cbdc9493969ee9b5a1e25519369785dd6ab",
